WEBVTT

00:06:28.199 --> 00:06:30.976
stressni kamaytrish yoki oilaviy 
turmushingizni yaxshilash

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.888
yoki yuqori sifatli, kaloriyasiz 
shokoladni yegandek his etishni

00:06:34.912 --> 00:06:36.976
yoki asrlardan buyon kiymagan

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:42.833
kamzulingizdan 25 funt topib olgandek
his qilishni yoki o'zingiz va

00:06:42.857 --> 00:06:46.371
atrofingizdagilarning uzoq, 
sog’lom va baxtliroq umr kechirishlariga

00:06:46.395 --> 00:06:49.357
ko’maklashuvchi g'ayritabiiy kuchingizdan

00:06:49.381 --> 00:06:53.184
foydalanmoqchi bo’lsangiz,

00:06:53.208 --> 00:06:54.507
tabassum qiling.

00:06:54.531 --> 00:06:59.238
(Qarsaklar)